pth pattern from\n\n[t+05:41/60:00 c65/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_bo16qjvq","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/i.ar && grep -rn \"REQUESTS.log\" emacs.d/ --include=\"*.el\" | grep -v test | head -5; echo \"---\"; grep -rn \"defun iar--reqlog\\|defun iar--log-request\\|defun iar--request-log\" emacs.d/ --include=\"*.el\" | head -5"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[14:15:18] emacs.d/init.d/agent/iar-agent-cycle.el:622:responses mid-work in any REQUESTS.log census (echoes appear only\nemacs.d/init.d/security/iar-audit-log.el:242:REQUESTS.log, relay 0081). Redaction here is the structural\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:14:;; What gets logged (audit/<project>/<agent>/REQUESTS.log):\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:52:;; sanitization as the audit log), rotated to REQUESTS.log.1 at\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:75:  \"When non-nil, log gptel request lifecycles to REQUESTS.log.\n---\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:137:(defun iar--reqlog-cap (s n)\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:158:(defun iar--reqlog-payload-tail (messages)\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:183:(defun iar--reqlog-roles (messages n)\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:205:(defun iar--reqlog-tool-specs (tool-use)\nemacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el:233:(defun iar--reqlog-log-dir ()\n\n[t+05:44/60:00 c66/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_k3qj83zf","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/i.ar && grep -n \"sanitize\\|redact\" emacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-request-log.el | head -10"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[14:15:19] 51:;; Storage: single-line sanitized entries (log-injection safe, same\n208:A2b sanitizer these always have string :name and plist-or-nil :args,\n284:  \"Append one sanitized single-line entry to REQUESTS.log.\n294:             (line (iar