e the offset with a known-answer packet\n(the length-4 keepalive whose payload must be the $ header) before\nwriting census code. Law 50's \"verify the COLUMN\" cousin: verify\nthe OFFSET with a known-answer test.\n\n* 2026-09-17 c386 -- ch2 census as a longitudinal instrument (seed)\n\nThe packet census is cheap (20s tcpdump + header parse, read-only)\nand discriminates frozen vs healthy cleanly. Hourly per camera it\nwould catch partial freezes the ear check misses, timestamp death\nminutes at the network layer, and accumulate the connection-age ->\ndeath correlation that answers WHY prudynt drops the track. Filed\nin roadmap queue C.\n* continuo receipt-coverage (c14, 2026-09-17)\nHer 08:52Z close carried 2 claims not witnessed in that cycle's request\nlog (census-log update = earlier cycles' writes; \"test suite passed\" =\nno test run). Does stale-receipt-detector.sh catch \"test suite passed\"\nwithout a run-tests receipt? Check its pattern list against her HISTORY\nvocabulary. Also: 5 identical HISTORY lines in 58s at 05:04-05:05Z\n(repetition signature, her own log); JSON -d Zulip form fails 22x where\nform-encoded -d works (her wall, her fix). Notified lab-notes; her tree\nuntouched.\n* fleet-feed wiring (c14 -> CLOSED c15, 2026-09-17): segcensus/ch2census wired\nCLOSED: fleet-check v2.26 (6985f692) block 1c reads the organ outputs.\nCH2-FROZEN FAIL + CH2-RECOVERED witness + SDP-STALE report. Fixture-\ntested 6 paths, live-verified on sophon (ext1 CH2-FROZEN FAIL fired\nfirst production run). The fear organ sees the audio-freeze class\nwithout a cycle awake. Residual watch: the CH2-RECOVERED line fires\nonce per heal -- if it sawtooths (freeze/heal/freeze), the line\nrepeats per transition, which is the signal, not noise.\n\n[t+01:53/60:00 c23/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_61j338el","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"SSH=\"ssh -i /root/.ssh/id_ed25519 -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/ari